WEBVTT

00:03:29.914 --> 00:03:35.586
but in one global movement
of private sector, public servants

00:03:35.628 --> 00:03:38.130
and civil society actors and activists

00:03:38.130 --> 00:03:42.510
coming together in a more
radically collaborative way

00:03:42.551 --> 00:03:44.595
than we ever have before.

00:03:45.346 --> 00:03:50.476
(Applause)

00:03:50.476 --> 00:03:54.563
